# Gentleman Guardian Angel Configuration

PROVIDER="codex"
FILE_PATTERNS="*.sh,*.zsh,*.bash,.zshrc,.bashrc,.bash_profile,.tmux.conf"
EXCLUDE_PATTERNS="*.log,*.bak,node_modules,target,.git"
RULES_FILE="AGENTS.md"
STRICT_MODE="false"

# Provider: the global ~/.config/gga/config pins every repository to OpenAI Codex with
# GPT-6.1-Sol at medium reasoning (GGA_PROVIDER overrides this file and a shim sets the
# model), so this value only documents the intent and keeps `gga` working without it.
# STRICT_MODE="false" keeps the gate advisory: a provider hiccup or an ambiguous reply
# never blocks a commit. "true" blocks whenever the reply lacks exactly one
# "STATUS: PASSED|FAILED" line.
